{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\n『キャンパスライブ＠福島SP』に\nちーちゃん、ひめたんと出演させていただきました＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごーく緊張しましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福島市に行って\n東日本大震災について改めて考えられて\n本当にたくさんの事を知れたし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大学生のみなさまがすごくしっかりしてらっしゃって\n自分ももっとしっかりしなきゃ！という意味でも\n意識を高められました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/12/8197066/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今井アナも心強くて\nスタッフさんがたも優しくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出演できて良かったなー\nって思いでいっぱいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/12/8197066/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/12/8197066/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公開生放送に来てくださったみなさんも\n寒い中、体育館で\nマナーよく聴いてくださって\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/12/8197066/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/12/8197066/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}